{
  "documentNumber": "2013A27132",
  "articleNumber": "238",
  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-238\">\n    <header class=\"article-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 238</h2>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"article-content\">\n        <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-1er\">\n            <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n            <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                <p>Lors <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-12-08/42\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"11\">de la <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"4\" data-dossier-number=\"2018-12-20/52\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"12\">commande</span> du titre de séjour de plus de trois mois</span>, la <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"7\" data-dossier-number=\"2024-06-06/22\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"6\">personne primo-arrivante</span> est informée :</p>\n                <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">des obligations visées à l'article 152/7, § 1er, alinéa 1er, et § 2, <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-12-08/42\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"11\">...</span>, du Code <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"6\" data-dossier-number=\"2024-06-06/22\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"2\">décrétal</span>;</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">des sanctions applicables en cas de méconnaissance de l'obligation visée à l'article 152/7, § 2,<span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-12-08/42\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"11\">...</span>, du Code <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"6\" data-dossier-number=\"2024-06-06/22\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"2\">décrétal</span>;</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">du centre compétent;</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\"><span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"5\" data-dossier-number=\"2024-06-06/22\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"13\">...</span></span></li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-2\">\n            <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n            <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                <p>Lors de <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-12-08/42\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"11\">la commande de son titre de séjour de plus de trois mois</span>, l'administration communale remet à la <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"7\" data-dossier-number=\"2024-06-06/22\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"6\">personne primo-arrivante</span> un document informatif relatif au <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-12-08/42\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"3\">Parcours d'intégration</span>, dans la langue comprise par le primo-arrivant, contre accusé de réception.</p>\n                <p>L'accusé de réception visé à l'alinéa 1er contient, au minimum :</p>\n                <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">les nom et prénom du primo-arrivant;</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">son numéro de registre national dans le respect de la loi du 8 août 1983 organisant un registre national des personnes physiques;</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">ses coordonnées;</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">la date de <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-12-08/42\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"11\">la commande de son titre de séjour de plus de trois mois</span> à la commune;</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">la confirmation de ce qu'il est informé des obligations visées au paragraphe 1er, 1° et des sanctions <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"4\" data-dossier-number=\"2018-12-20/52\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"12\">visées au paragraphe 1er, 2°</span>.</span></li>\n                </ol>\n                <p><span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-12-08/42\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"11\">L'administration communale complète et transmet au centre compétent la liste des <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"7\" data-dossier-number=\"2024-06-06/22\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"6\">personnes primo-arrivantes</span> ayant commandé leur titre de séjour de plus de trois mois, accompagnée de leurs accusés de réception. La convention visée à l'article 237 détermine la fréquence de la transmission de la liste. Elle est au minimum mensuelle.</span></p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-3\">\n            <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 3.</h3>\n            <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                <p><span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"4\" data-dossier-number=\"2018-12-20/52\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"12\">...</span></p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </div>\n</article>",
